{
  "title": "I Reincarnated As A Mob Villain In An Otome Game I Was Bashing Away At, But I'm Gonna Live Straight Because I Don't Wanna Be Condemned",
  "description": "Kanda Hajime, an avid gamer and overworked office worker, collapses from exhaustion—only to wake up as Ridd, the villain of the otome game \"TokiRella\"! Awaiting him is an unavoidable fate: condemnation and ruin.\n\nDetermined to escape this grim ending, Ridd leverages his sharp intellect and deep knowledge of the game to rewrite his destiny. His first goal? Mending his broken family—a cold, distant father, a lonely sister, and a bedridden mother.\n\nBut as he sets out to change their fates, his actions ripple far beyond the game’s original story, igniting a revolution that will shake the entire continent!",
  "artist": "TOBARI Chomo",
  "author": "MIZUNA",
